# Local UAT screenshots
ui_*.png
/work/

# Logo build output (published to gh-pages branch)
/site/

# Root-level screenshots from UAT (real assets live in subdirs)
/*.png

# Private working notes — never publish. These are untracked by intent, and on
# 2026-09-10 a `git add -A` swept both onto the public remote for ~20 minutes.
# Ignoring them makes that mistake impossible rather than merely discouraged.
# HOW-TO-TEST-THE-CARDS.md is addressed to a child by name.
/SESSION_STATE.md
/HOW-TO-TEST-THE-CARDS.md
